  timeout?: number,
}): Promise<unknown>"},{"path":"tools["chrome-devtools"].fill_form","description":"Fill out multiple form elements (inputs, selects, checkboxes, radios) at once. ALWAYS prefer this tool over multiple individual 'fill' or 'click' calls when interacting with forms. It is significantly faster, more reliable, and reduces turn count. Example: Fill username, password, and check "Remember Me" in one call.","signature":"tools["chrome-devtools"].fill_form({
