}): Promise<unknown>"},{"path":"tools["chrome-devtools"].list_pages","description":"Get a list of pages open in the browser.","signature":"tools["chrome-devtools"].list_pages(): Promise<unknown>"},{"path":"tools["chrome-devtools"].list_network_requests","description":"Lists the most recent requests for the target page since the last navigation.","signature":"tools["chrome-devtools"].list_network_requests({
